# steps/named-struct-exec.md, slice 2: executing a named Structure runs its declarations again, and this
# slice runs a number field's only -- an array field's declaration is refused where it stands.
Buf:
    size_t: n 0U
    []: int cells 4
    n: n + 1U
return
Buf
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
